        "name": "USN-9102-1",
        "description": "Jonathan Looney discovered that H2O incorrectly handled certain HTTP/2 traffic. A remote attacker could possibly use these issues to cause H2O to consume excessive resources, leading to a denial of service. (CVE-2019-9512, CVE-2019-9514, CVE-2019-9515)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2019-9512",
          "CVE-2019-9514",
